@host = http://localhost:5165

### Create a payment (use any GUID as the order id for now)
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "0197a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001",
  "amount": 125.50,
  "currency": "eur"
}

### Get a payment (paste the id from the response above)
GET {{host}}/payments/01a1d015-629b-7933-8efa-b59abc310bca

### Invalid payment (should return 400)
POST {{host}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "amount": 0,
  "currency": "EU"
}

### Unknown payment (should return 404)
GET {{host}}/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000